      },
      {
        "native_id": "4pqd42yx39mr",
        "status": "resolved",
        "body": "We have confirmed with our banking partner that the issue has been resolved. All impacted Canadian payouts scheduled for April 14th have successfully posted on the same day. Thank you for your patience.",
